    "name": "Dinosaurs in Place",
    "steam_appid": 3305650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305650/extras/0131a19b1c21ea93fc501c5f9f7b60fb.avif?t=1741107635\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Dinosaurs in Place</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embark on a prehistoric adventure? In <strong>Dinosaurs in Place</strong>, you'll meet 40 unique dinosaurs, each with its own shape and character. Your task is to place them on the grid so that they fit perfectly into the allotted space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through 100 exciting levels, each of which will challenge your logic and imagination. Move and rotate the dinosaur figures to find the perfect combination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40 Unique Dinosaurs</strong><br>Collect a roster of 40 hand-drawn dinosaurs of various shapes and sizes, each bringing its own unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Thoughtfully Designed Levels</strong><br>Dive into 100 levels that will keep your mind sharp and provide hours of engaging gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple and Intuitive Controls</strong><br>Navigate effortlessly using the left and right mouse buttons \u2014 perfect for players of all skill levels. Simply grab a figure with the left mouse button and move it to the desired spot, then rotate it with the right mouse button for a perfect fit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Musical Accompaniment</strong><br>Enjoy relaxing music and sounds that transport you to the captivating world of dinosaurs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convenient Hint System</strong><br>Stuck on a level? Don\u2019t worry! The game features a hint system that will highlight possible placement spots for your figures, helping you advance without any hassle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305650/extras/cc6d7981f5b2d4eb6698f9435f50b2b3.poster.avif?t=1741107635\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305650/extras/cc6d7981f5b2d4eb6698f9435f50b2b3.webm?t=1741107635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305650/extras/cc6d7981f5b2d4eb6698f9435f50b2b3.mp4?t=1741107635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinosaurs in Place</strong> is the perfect blend of captivating puzzles and stunning graphics, offering you hours of delightful entertainment. Join our prehistoric world and showcase your logical skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305650/extras/0ae38130e7e2e32f3801975e083705f3.webp?t=1741107635\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305650/extras/0131a19b1c21ea93fc501c5f9f7b60fb.avif?t=1741107635\" width=800 height=62 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Dinosaurs in Place</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embark on a prehistoric adventure? In <strong>Dinosaurs in Place</strong>, you'll meet 40 unique dinosaurs, each with its own shape and character. Your task is to place them on the grid so that they fit perfectly into the allotted space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through 100 exciting levels, each of which will challenge your logic and imagination. Move and rotate the dinosaur figures to find the perfect combination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40 Unique Dinosaurs</strong><br>Collect a roster of 40 hand-drawn dinosaurs of various shapes and sizes, each bringing its own unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Thoughtfully Designed Levels</strong><br>Dive into 100 levels that will keep your mind sharp and provide hours of engaging gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple and Intuitive Controls</strong><br>Navigate effortlessly using the left and right mouse buttons \u2014 perfect for players of all skill levels. Simply grab a figure with the left mouse button and move it to the desired spot, then rotate it with the right mouse button for a perfect fit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Musical Accompaniment</strong><br>Enjoy relaxing music and sounds that transport you to the captivating world of dinosaurs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convenient Hint System</strong><br>Stuck on a level? Don\u2019t worry! The game features a hint system that will highlight possible placement spots for your figures, helping you advance without any hassle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305650/extras/cc6d7981f5b2d4eb6698f9435f50b2b3.poster.avif?t=1741107635\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305650/extras/cc6d7981f5b2d4eb6698f9435f50b2b3.webm?t=1741107635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305650/extras/cc6d7981f5b2d4eb6698f9435f50b2b3.mp4?t=1741107635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinosaurs in Place</strong> is the perfect blend of captivating puzzles and stunning graphics, offering you hours of delightful entertainment. Join our prehistoric world and showcase your logical skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305650/extras/0ae38130e7e2e32f3801975e083705f3.webp?t=1741107635\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In this exciting two-dimensional puzzle game, you need to place your prehistoric friends on the grid so that they fit perfectly. Dinosaurs in Place offers 100 unique levels and 40 diverse dinosaurs that will not leave you indifferent.",
